<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第三幕 · 它是不是变量</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>你现在跑的那套，是把治理内建好的成品</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24}}><Box style={{width: 384, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 32px", background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 88, fontWeight: 700, color: "#0F6E56", lineHeight: 1.0}}>4</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", marginTop: 16}}>样治理能力</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", marginTop: 10}}>开箱即用，不用你从零搭。</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 744, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", gap: 18}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 16}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 20, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>沙箱</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)"}}>默认可用 · 按目录与网络收口</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 20, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>审批</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)"}}>敏感操作可挂起等人</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 16}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 20, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>事件流</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)"}}>每一步有记录</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 20, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>长程记忆</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)"}}>跨轮任务不失忆</Text></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 600, color: "#0F6E56", marginTop: 14}}>所有成品都把这四样当卖点——这是整个品类在那圈东西上投的票。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>27 / 45</Text></Box></Box>
